        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6631, 12 Inch Newbury Collection Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe timelessness of the Newbury Refrigerator Pull makes it a great addition to the kitchen where there is often a blend of the old and the new. Depending on the finish you choose, this appliance pull by RK International would be great in almost any decor. Polished Nickel would look great in ultra modern homes while the Oil Rubbed Bronze finish gives this cabinet pull a more classic look. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AP-PH-6631 Newbury Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-131\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/newbury-cabinet-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Newbury Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newbury Collection Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
